    <a href="/blog/government-jobs/defence-services-career-india">defence services career India</a> guide
    for NDA, CDS, Technical Entry, and Agnipath side by side before you narrow down to the Navy specifically.
  </p>

  <p>
    If you want a second opinion on whether the discipline, sea postings, and hierarchy of a Navy career
    genuinely fit how you work and live — versus other government or private paths — a session inside
    <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/">career guidance</a>
    can help you test that fit before you commit a year of preparation to one exam family.
  </p>

